@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Help"; }
<section class="pub-page-top container"><p class="pub-kicker">HELP &amp; SUPPORT</p><h1>Let's find your<br /><em>next step.</em></h1><p class="pub-lead">Choose the problem below. During an active exam, follow the on-screen recovery instructions and keep your teacher informed.</p><nav class="pub-jump" aria-label="Help topics"><a href="#account">Signing in ↓</a><a href="#devices">Camera &amp; microphone ↓</a><a href="#exam">Exam problems ↓</a><a href="#support">Contact your organiser ↓</a></nav></section>
<section class="container pub-support-grid"><article id="account"><i class="bi bi-person-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i><h2>I can't sign in</h2><ol><li>Check the email address and password you registered with.</li><li>Use the password-recovery link on the sign-in page if needed.</li><li>If you are a teacher, confirm that your account has been approved.</li></ol><a class="pub-text-link" asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Login">Go to sign in →</a></article><article id="devices"><i class="bi bi-camera-video" aria-hidden="true"></i><h2>My device isn't working</h2><ol><li>Check that the camera or microphone is connected and not being used by another application.</li><li>Open the browser's site permissions and allow the requested device access.</li><li>Use the system's recovery or retry instructions. For screen sharing, choose the source required by your exam.</li></ol><p>During an exam, avoid closing the tab or repeatedly reloading. Ask your teacher for help if recovery fails.</p></article><article id="exam"><i class="bi bi-journal-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><h2>I can't enter or continue</h2><ol><li>Confirm the schedule, entry window and candidate assignment.</li><li>Read the exact setup, warning or pause message.</li><li>If the attempt is blocked, use the review/recovery option provided. A teacher may need to authorise the next step.</li></ol><a class="pub-text-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Faq">Read examination questions →</a></article><article><i class="bi bi-cloud-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><h2>My answer hasn't saved</h2><ol><li>Check the answer-saving status and your connection.</li><li>Wait for a saved confirmation before moving on when possible.</li><li>Tell your teacher if saving continues to fail. Avoid duplicate exam tabs or repeated submissions.</li></ol><p>After submitting, wait for the session confirmation.</p></article></section>
<section id="support" class="pub-section container pub-split"><div><p class="pub-kicker">WHEN YOU NEED MORE HELP</p><h2>Contact your teacher<br />or examination organiser.</h2><p>Use the contact details your institution gave you. This page provides guidance; it does not send a support request.</p><p>For an account approval issue, contact the administrator responsible for your institution.</p></div><aside class="pub-note"><h3>Have these details ready</h3><ul class="pub-checklist"><li>Your full name and Candidate ID</li><li>The exam name and date</li><li>The time the problem occurred</li><li>The exact error message or a relevant screenshot</li></ul><p class="pub-small">Never share your password or verification codes. Send screenshots only through your organiser's authorised support channel.</p></aside></section>